<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>小步试错 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</title><link>https://yousali.com/tags/%E5%B0%8F%E6%AD%A5%E8%AF%95%E9%94%99/</link><description>Recent content in 小步试错 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.148.1</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:33:45 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yousali.com/tags/%E5%B0%8F%E6%AD%A5%E8%AF%95%E9%94%99/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>还没等文件下来，小岗村 18 户先把地分了</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/xiaogang-village-1978-experiment/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/xiaogang-village-1978-experiment/</guid><description>1978年冬，安徽凤阳小岗村18户村民冒着政策风险悄悄按手印分田到户，次年秋收打下13.3万斤粮食，随后家庭联产承包责任制逐步在全国推开。</description></item><item><title>开季前只定三成货，Zara 把赌注留到上架之后</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/zara-small-batch-testing/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/zara-small-batch-testing/</guid><description>不像传统服装厂提前大半年锁定八九成库存，Zara 开季前只定约三成基础款，靠门店小批量试卖与近岸快反在两三周内决定加单或停产。</description></item><item><title>烧掉六千种材料，才找到京都那根竹子</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/edison-bamboo-filament-tests/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/edison-bamboo-filament-tests/</guid><description>1879到1880年，爱迪生团队在缺乏现成材料公式时，先在门洛帕克实验室用低成本台架测试约6000种植物纤维，最终筛出能亮上千小时的京都真竹灯丝。</description></item></channel></rss>